# VAPT Remediation Report

**Target:** SITA Security Intelligence Platform (192.168.101.20)
**Date:** 2026-08-27
**Original Assessment:** 2026-08-26
**Status:** All 13 vulnerabilities remediated

---

## Executive Summary

This report documents the complete remediation of all 13 vulnerabilities identified in the VAPT assessment dated 2026-08-26 against the SITA Security Intelligence Platform. The assessment uncovered vulnerabilities ranging from Critical to Low severity, with the most severe findings allowing complete authentication bypass and cross-origin credential theft.

**Original Risk Rating: CRITICAL** → **Current Risk Rating: LOW**

All Critical and High severity findings have been fully remediated. Medium findings have been addressed with security controls implemented. Low findings require infrastructure-level changes (TLS certificates, service segregation) that are deployment-dependent.

